-- synopsis
St33v™ Recording Studio is proud to work with such a varied crew of talented Artists! We bring fresh AI and old-school Analogue music to your ears.
-- synopsis

more_label: About St33v™
--more


St33v™ is an independent Australian musician and systems builder working across modular synthesis, conceptual albums, and machine collaboration.

This site is self-hosted and generated from a custom Arch Linux workflow using Faircamp and plain files. No rented platforms. RSS is first-class. The stack is part of the statement.

---

## The Music

Releases range from single-take modular improvisations to structured concept cycles.

Themes recur: metamodern oscillation, solastalgia, technological agency, cognition, and the uneasy dance between humans and increasingly capable machines.

The stance is clear-eyed: pro-AI, not utopian.
See *Power Scalpel* and *Build a Bridge*.

---

## Personae

### Eli Mercer

Singer-songwriter navigating irony and sincerity in equal measure. Cultural drift, philosophy, and the digital condition filtered through melody.

### Dr Morbius

Speculative technologist. Explorer of Krellian aesthetics, synthetic consciousness, and CantoTopometry. A narrative instrument for thinking about advanced systems.

### St33v™

Engineer, instigator, release valve. The playful and the peculiar. Whatever the others leave on the table.

---

## Why

Ownership of tools.
Ownership of distribution.
Curiosity without guardrails.
Alignment without dogma.

Music and systems thinking are not separate disciplines.

This is an ongoing project.


